SAMPLE1 '\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\np_1(1) &= 1^2 + 2 \\cdot 1 + 2 = 1 + 2 + 2 = 5, \\\\\np_2(1) &= 1^2 - 2 \\cdot 1 + 2 = 1 - 2 + 2 = 1, \\\\\np_3(1) &= 1 - 1 = 0, \\\\\np_4(1) &= 1 + 1 = 2, \\\\\np_5(1) &= 1 + 1 = 2.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\nSumming these values:\n\n\\[5 + 1 + 0 + 2 + 2 = 10\\]\n\nThus, the final answer is:\n\n\\[\\boxed{10}\\]'
